{"title":"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_CRITICALLY_THINK!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (HOW TO CRITICALLY THINK!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Driving along a highway, Megan noticed that her odometer showed <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/0/fe03798054ce5c2d1aef8db8237a5bdbb4b063ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15951$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" /> (miles). This number is a palindrome-it reads the same forward and backward. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours later, the odometer displayed the next higher palindrome. What was her average speed, in miles per hour, during this <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-hour period?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/0/2504de9a10e83a09cd5d5852042f3a61b6c1c32c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 50 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 55 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 60 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 65 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In order to get the smallest palindrome greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/0/fe03798054ce5c2d1aef8db8237a5bdbb4b063ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15951$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" />, we need to raise the middle digit. If we were to raise any of the digits after the middle, we would be forced to also raise a digit before the middle to keep it a palindrome, making it unnecessarily larger.\n</p><p>So we raise <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to the next largest value, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, but obviously, that's not how place value works, so we're in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/1/53130630759e032f794984432ae7baad714fbc9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" />s now. To keep this a palindrome, our number is now <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/f/1ff7b4b72784a06b0f0864bf2053e783cd4c7272.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16061$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" />. \n</p><p>So Megan drove <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/a/c3aec0e6087346f76e40332116c31ad9875224a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16061-15951=110$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"164\" height=\"13\" /> miles. Since this happened over <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours, she drove at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/e/c4eeee546b069bb869376d1a08463637c5a0427b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{110}{2}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }55}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"120\" height=\"37\" /> mph. ~quacker88\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28HOW_TO_CRITICALLY_THINK.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_CRITICALLY_THINK!!!)\">Video Solution (HOW TO CRITICALLY THINK!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (HOW TO CRITICALLY THINK!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/0zpMZZ8d3vs\">https://youtu.be/0zpMZZ8d3vs</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/OHR_6U686Qg\">https://youtu.be/OHR_6U686Qg</a>\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/0bfIDBkfcZs\">https://youtu.be/0bfIDBkfcZs</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ZhAZ1oPe5Ds?t=1361\">https://youtu.be/ZhAZ1oPe5Ds?t=1361</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B\">2020 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href